00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:41.430
Hey, I'm back.

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:45.140
How was it, Hoozuki?

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:48.230
Are you drunk, Kazuma?

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:50.350
