00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:05.390
How did you... Did something happen to Kazuma?

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:10.890
Toshihiko. No matter where you run,
the Kifuuken will find you and kill you.

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.390
